    "Düşüncelerini ve favori sosyal medya bağlantılarını (Spotify, YouTube, Instagram...) gerçek duvarlara ve mekânlara AR yüzey kilitleme ile sabitle.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Düşüncelerini ve favori sosyal medya bağlantılarını (Spotify, YouTube, Instagram...) gerçek duvarlara ve mekânlara AR yüzey kilitleme ile sabitle."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pin your thoughts and favorite social media links (Spotify, YouTube, Instagram...) to real walls and spaces with AR surface locking."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "通过 AR 表面锁定将您的想法和最喜爱的社交媒体链接（Spotify、YouTube、Instagram...）固定到真实的墙壁和空间。"
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "अपने विचारों और पसंदीदा सोशल मीडिया लिंक (Spotify, YouTube, Instagram...) को AR सरफेस लॉकिंग के साथ वास्तविक दीवारों और स्थानों पर पिन करें।"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fija tus pensamientos y enlaces de redes sociales favoritos (Spotify, YouTube, Instagram...) en paredes y espacios reales con bloqueo de superficie AR."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Épinglez vos pensées et vos liens de réseaux sociaux préférés (Spotify, YouTube, Instagram...) sur de vrais murs et espaces grâce au verrouillage de surface AR."
          }
        },
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "قم بتثبيت أفكارك وروابط الوسائط الاجتماعية المفضلة لديك (Spotify، YouTube، Instagram...) على الجدران والمساحات الحقيقية باستخدام قفل السطح AR."
          }
        },
        "bn": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AR পৃষ্ঠে স্থির করার সুবিধা দিয়ে আপনার ভাবনা ও প্রিয় সোশ্যাল মিডিয়া লিঙ্ক (Spotify, YouTube, Instagram…) বাস্তব দেয়াল ও স্থানে যুক্ত করুন।"
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fixe seus pensamentos e links de redes sociais favoritos (Spotify, YouTube, Instagram...) em paredes e espaços reais com bloqueio de superfície AR."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Прикрепите свои мысли и ссылки на любимые социальные сети (Spotify, YouTube, Instagram...) к реальным стенам и пространствам с помощью блокировки поверхности AR."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pinnen Sie Ihre Gedanken und bevorzugten Social-Media-Links (Spotify, YouTube, Instagram...) mit der AR-Oberflächensperre an reale Wände und Räume."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AR サーフェス ロックを使用して、考えやお気に入りのソーシャル メディア リンク (Spotify、YouTube、Instagram など) を実際の壁や空間にピン留めします。"
          }
        }
      },
      "comment": "Translated and editorially checked against the English UI meaning, 2026-10-04. Verify compiled resources, VoiceOver, wrapping and RTL in native QA."
    },
